From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thibaut Lapierre <root@epheo.eu>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/15] kcm: terminated pod gc threshold

kubeControllerManager.terminatedPodGCThreshold sets the pod garbage
collector's threshold (default unchanged, 12500). Graceful node shutdown
leaves every pod it stops as a terminated pod; small nodes want a lower
value.

Upstream: no KCM config section as of 5.0.
Covered by: config and KCM unit tests.
